        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Zoda’s Revenge: StarTropics II is an action-adventure game for the Nintendo Entertainment System and the sequel to StarTropics. The game follows Mike Jones as he travels through different time periods to recover the Tetrads and confront the alien villain Zoda.\n\nGameplay combines top-down exploration with dungeon-based action. Compared with the first game, it allows eight-directional movement. It includes settings based on historical and fictionalised periods, with Mike encountering figures such as Cleopatra, Sherlock Holmes and Leonardo da Vinci.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
